fix-session-desc.translation:
Instrução: Adicionar coluna description à tabela wp_cc_pack_sessions, persistir a descrição rica (jogadores + recompensas + coins) gerada no JS, e usar no patch do formulário. Cinco arquivos: includes/class-activator.php, includes/class-session.php, includes/class-api.php, public/store.js, _patch/form-geral-pack.patch.php.

=== 1. includes/class-activator.php — adicionar description em $sql2 ===

Em create_tables(), localizar $sql2. Localizar a linha:
    composition JSON NOT NULL,

Após ela, inserir:
    description TEXT DEFAULT NULL,

=== 2. includes/class-activator.php — maybe_migrate adiciona description em $t2 ===

No método maybe_migrate(), após o bloco que trata $t1 (os dois if de coins_amount e coins_platform), adicionar:

    $t2    = $wpdb->prefix . CC_PACKS_SESSIONS_TABLE;
    $cols2 = $wpdb->get_col( "SHOW COLUMNS FROM {$t2}" );
    if ( ! in_array( 'description', $cols2, true ) ) {
        $wpdb->query( "ALTER TABLE {$t2} ADD COLUMN description TEXT DEFAULT NULL AFTER composition" );
    }

=== 3. includes/class-session.php — create() aceita description ===

Localizar a assinatura do método:
    public static function create( int $user_id, array $composition ): mixed {

Substituir por:
    public static function create( int $user_id, array $composition, string $description = '' ): mixed {

No array do $wpdb->insert(), após:
    'composition' => wp_json_encode( $composition ),

Adicionar:
    'description' => $description,

No array de formatos correspondente, após '%s' de composition, adicionar '%s':
    [ '%s', '%d', '%s', '%s', '%f', '%s' ]

=== 4. includes/class-api.php — create_session() passa description ===

Dentro de create_session(), após o foreach que monta $composition, adicionar:
    $description = sanitize_textarea_field( $body['description'] ?? '' );

Localizar:
    $token = CC_Packs_Session::create( get_current_user_id(), $composition );

Substituir por:
    $token = CC_Packs_Session::create( get_current_user_id(), $composition, $description );

=== 5. public/store.js — adicionar buildSessionDescription() ===

Antes da função buildCoinsCard(), adicionar:

    function buildSessionDescription(composition) {
        var parts = [];
        composition.forEach(function (item) {
            var pack = packsCache.find(function (p) { return String(p.id) === String(item.pack_id); });
            if (!pack) { parts.push('Pack #' + item.pack_id + ' x' + item.qty); return; }

            var names = [];
            if (feedCache && pack.dme_ids && pack.dme_ids.length) {
                var ids = pack.dme_ids.map(String);
                feedCache.forEach(function (d) {
                    if (ids.indexOf(String(d.id)) !== -1 && d.name) names.push(d.name);
                });
            }

            if (pack.coins_amount > 0) {
                names.push(formatCoins(pack.coins_amount) + ' Coins ' + (pack.coins_platform || 'PS').toUpperCase());
            }

            var line = item.qty + 'x ' + pack.name;
            if (names.length) line += ' [' + names.join(', ') + ']';
            parts.push(line);
        });
        return parts.join(' | ');
    }

=== 6. public/store.js — checkout envia description ===

Dentro do handler de #cc-bar-checkout, localizar:
    apiFetch(api + '/session', {
        method:  'POST',
        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
        body:    JSON.stringify({ composition: composition }),
    })

Substituir por:
    var description = buildSessionDescription(composition);
    apiFetch(api + '/session', {
        method:  'POST',
        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
        body:    JSON.stringify({ composition: composition, description: description }),
    })

=== 7. _patch/form-geral-pack.patch.php — usar description quando disponível ===

Dentro de fg_load_pack_order_by_token(), localizar o bloco que monta $parts e $desc:
    $parts = [];
    $packs_table = $wpdb->prefix . 'cc_packs';
    foreach ( $composition as $pack_id => $qty ) {
        $pack = $wpdb->get_row(
            $wpdb->prepare( "SELECT name FROM {$packs_table} WHERE id = %d", intval( $pack_id ) ),
            ARRAY_A
        );
        $name = $pack ? fg_sline( $pack['name'] ) : "Pack #{$pack_id}";
        $parts[] = "{$name} x{$qty}";
    }
    $desc = $parts ? implode( ', ', $parts ) : 'Packs selecionados';

Substituir por:
    $stored_desc = isset( $row['description'] ) ? trim( (string) $row['description'] ) : '';
    if ( $stored_desc !== '' ) {
        $desc = $stored_desc;
    } else {
        $parts = [];
        $packs_table = $wpdb->prefix . 'cc_packs';
        foreach ( $composition as $pack_id => $qty ) {
            $pack = $wpdb->get_row(
                $wpdb->prepare( "SELECT name FROM {$packs_table} WHERE id = %d", intval( $pack_id ) ),
                ARRAY_A
            );
            $name = $pack ? fg_sline( $pack['name'] ) : "Pack #{$pack_id}";
            $parts[] = "{$name} x{$qty}";
        }
        $desc = $parts ? implode( ', ', $parts ) : 'Packs selecionados';
    }

Verificação: (1) $sql2 em create_tables() contém description TEXT DEFAULT NULL após composition. (2) maybe_migrate() aplica ALTER TABLE ADD COLUMN description em wp_cc_pack_sessions. (3) Session::create() aceita $description e insere na tabela com formato '%s'. (4) API::create_session() extrai description do body e passa para Session::create(). (5) buildSessionDescription() definida em store.js antes de buildCoinsCard(). (6) Checkout envia description no payload JSON. (7) fg_load_pack_order_by_token() usa $row['description'] quando não vazio, com fallback para loop de nomes.
